  <item>
    <title>vol.010 暴力的第一人称</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671bacdd44ae79002c0e1870</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671bacdd44ae79002c0e1870</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Oct 2024 14:36:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>《讨厌作品的心情》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>什么是无可避免 无可指责</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>对于作品只付出了泪水</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>临门一脚的成功让我陷入颓唐的漩涡</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>什么是尽心竭力尽力而为</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>短竭的气息吹不出一个宏大的热气球</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我见他长久 生出厌恶的情绪</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>越来越觉得低级幼稚羞于见人</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>所以我不懂&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>妈妈你是如何面对我</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我没法爱一个事物爱得长久</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《夏夜》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>尊敬 我的父亲</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>充满了睿智的神光</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>他在夏夜掀起我的蚊帐</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>虫蛇与我在梦中缠斗</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>溽热浓稠的绿色夜晚</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>他冷静地注视他的孩子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>蚊虫侵犯我的肌肤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>像脓疮溃烂使我怒火中烧</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>卑鄙的爱是豹子的眼睛</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不能告人的痛苦争斗</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘘 安静</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>平静地收割夏季的成果</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我拍死了纷纷的蚊虫</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>细瘦的青蛇咬向我的脚踝</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>狠戾的怒火咬断蛇的脊骨</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>但是我也毒素发作很快休克死去</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我尝不到苦涩的胆汁 墨绿的血</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>静谧的湖泊与死亡的床</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>蟾蜍盯着这平静的局面</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>美丽的目标 消失在他的视线里</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我的父亲 他失望地离开了</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>他脆弱的孩子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《蓝玻璃》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>风打碎了廉价的蓝玻璃</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>救出了困在房里的少年</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>县城里粗野的未来主义&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>遗落于城市的蓝图之外</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>蓝色玻璃所封固住的蓝色空间</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>被那天吹进来的风所搅动</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>在房中上下回响发出铃铃的絮语</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>寂寞的茧房说着，未来&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>镰刀割下旧世界的阳具</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>泡沫浮荡 乳房与潮水相拥</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>欢乐的世界迎来新生 我们相信</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>世界只会变得越来越美</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>地板 木柜 团结稳定的像精巧的头骨</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>眼球的神光自某日午后悄然消逝</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>当时 一个人说 一万个人都在说</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>明天 高潮欢快的未来等待着我</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>换上的蓝玻璃太过忧郁</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>阳光被剥离成哀伤的视线</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>城市的更迭遗忘了父辈&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>在阳光明媚的那天 寂寞的蓝色骨头</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>二十一世纪 没有衰老的花流泪的雨</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>无情的风碾碎廉价的玻璃</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>孑孑的风声 清脆破碎的肋骨间</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>新生的头颅与四肢和一块说谎的岩石</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>父亲身体里爬出个少年 一个新世界，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>一万个人都在说。 男孩也说，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;明天！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>高潮欢快的未来等待着我</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《该隐》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我杀死了我的兄弟，我把他推入井中</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我可以舍弃我的亲友，田间的蔬菜</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>可以舍弃陈旧的祭台，允许</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>突如其来的愤怒，由着卑劣的性格</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>去冒险，去逃离无法忍受的历史</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>逃离无法顺位的命运</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>背过身体的一瞬间，就</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>终结一个孱弱的时刻</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>成为没有重量的锚点</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我把流着血的兄友</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>推掷进沉默的黑井</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>古代王朝自背后寂寥地哀鸣</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>逃离一个酒精浸湿的⻩昏</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>背负一根羽毛奔跑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>理所当然是轻松的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>所以跑的越来越快</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>失去制约的加速度</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>庞大的流星冲进平原</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>猎食的蜻蜓急掠湖面</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>透明啁啾的幽魂</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我丢弃的太多 杀死了太多</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;我否定⻘春的终结，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>惧惮 尘土堆积起的厚度，</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>这片土地&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>永远追踪着所有潜逃的罪犯&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>他永远潜伏等待着去惩罚你&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>以致附加的虚词越来越庞大&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>右脚羁绊着左脚成为一个庞大的虚影</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;无意义的集合，速度的囊肿</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;狂欢所收割下来的主谓宾&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>从来不能连成一句伶俐的话语&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>出于同样决绝的冒险 井口也接受了我&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《土地 》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>当这片土地展开杀戮，我们默许了&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>对于一条河流，他负担了&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>太多，牛与失衡的禽⻦，&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>人的尸体泡得透明&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>刀刃击打在黑色的土地上，我们&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>默许了这片土地的杀戮</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;沉默的野鹿，细小的⻦雀&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>枪口冒出绿色的烟雾，汩汩的血液流进</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;这片地土，生活在幽暗的阴影里</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;一代一代的恐惧被火焰加剧，我们&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>默许了这片土地的杀戮&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>对春天怀有恨意&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>乌龟脊背撞击水泥地，细竹竿&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>猛戳蛤蟆鼓胀的身体，⻜蛾翅膀的鳞粉 嵌</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>在指纹里，我们躬身于谋杀者&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>对同等的蓝蚂蚁施以狂暴的闪电&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>当这片土地展开杀戮</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我们默许了&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>上个月，白蚁扑向火光纷纷死去</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我们默许了，红太阳</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>藏在柳树后面，我们也默许了</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>溽热的夜晚我们睁大眼睛想看清&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>蚊帐外面的事物，水虿爬出池塘&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>蛙声中止，蝉吮吸树汁&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>当这片土地展开杀戮&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我们默许了这片土地颗粒无收的结果&nbsp;</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltSCb_y1SDslkPw0seNBdbJE4mPB.m4a" length="51180107" type="audio/mp4"/>
