    <title>vol.006 黑脸表演/假扮的表演和声音</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bff53c33591c27beab1edd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bff53c33591c27beab1edd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Aug 2024 00:56:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.hauserwirth.com/artists/33677-gary-simmons/" data-url="https://www.hauserwirth.com/artists/33677-gary-simmons/"><span>加里·西蒙斯 (Gary Simmons)</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuc-CRL1Ed3NM9J0El_SAaKWCPDg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNTcthcKV73pfweg3DT8-ElxV7t.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%91%E8%87%89%E6%89%AE%E8%A3%9D" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%91%E8%87%89%E6%89%AE%E8%A3%9D"><span>blackface 黑脸表演</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgP0mSCnosD1B5MswgmMNzz3kiIo.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLc1-Nyg11rUQ2bY4VVpzYdYo3g.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>播客推荐：《老娘腰子》</span></h2><span></span><h2><a href="https://player.fm/series/lao-niang-yao-zi-the-mind-candy/zhe-cai-bu-shi" data-url="https://player.fm/series/lao-niang-yao-zi-the-mind-candy/zhe-cai-bu-shi"><span>這才不是麻將！文化挪用超毋通！</span></a></h2><span></span><h2><a href="https://player.fm/series/lao-niang-yao-zi-the-mind-candy/wo-de-wen-hua-bu-shi" data-url="https://player.fm/series/lao-niang-yao-zi-the-mind-candy/wo-de-wen-hua-bu-shi"><span>我的文化不是你的玩物：欣賞/挪用大不同！ 我的文化不是你的玩物：欣赏/挪用大不同！</span></a></h2><span></span><h2><span>关于文化挪用的定义</span></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>文化挪用的四個條件</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>1. 挪用者的文化和被挪用的文化之間有權利不對等關係</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2. 挪用事件、挪用者和被挪用文化發生/屬於同一個社群或心理空間</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>3. 強勢的挪用者未尋求可靠資訊來源而造成錯誤的弱勢文化展示</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>4. 挪用者受益而被挪用者受到傷害</span></blockquote><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.voacantonese.com/a/%E9%87%87%E8%AE%BF%E6%AF%95%E4%B8%9A%E8%88%9E%E4%BC%9A%E7%A9%BF%E6%97%97%E8%A2%8D%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%BA%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%A9-%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E5%BC%95%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE-20180502/4376155.html" data-url="https://www.voacantonese.com/a/%E9%87%87%E8%AE%BF%E6%AF%95%E4%B8%9A%E8%88%9E%E4%BC%9A%E7%A9%BF%E6%97%97%E8%A2%8D%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%BA%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%A9-%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E5%BC%95%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE-20180502/4376155.html"><span>採訪畢業舞會穿旗袍白人女孩：為何引爭議？</span></a></h1><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuLtrbnY2Jfia11uTOooccqrJZH8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ganguro" data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ganguro"><span>ganguro</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://gyaru-109.fandom.com/wiki/B-Gyaru" data-url="https://gyaru-109.fandom.com/wiki/B-Gyaru"><span>b-gyaru</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuThR9AGpQL_odbTnoyenAey02b0.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZngH7wPX5fRpDza2-ghgEGN0lD.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%80%83%E5%87%BA%E7%B5%95%E5%91%BD%E9%8E%AE" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%80%83%E5%87%BA%E7%B5%95%E5%91%BD%E9%8E%AE"><span>《逃出绝命镇》</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiq2I6Bl1oE3wibsumgQBAZ1qbou.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>参考文献：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://doi.org/10.1080/10371397.2017.1297677" data-url="https://doi.org/10.1080/10371397.2017.1297677"><span>Consuming Women in Blackface: Racialized Affect and Transnational Femininity in Japanese Advertising</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《Love &nbsp;Theft Blackface Minstrelsy and the American Working Class 》Eric Lott, Greil Marcus</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Black Like You Blackface, Whiteface, Insult &nbsp;Imitation in American Popular Culture》 John Strausbaugh</span></p><span></span><p><span>《The Blacks 》Genet Jean</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Blackface》Ayanna Thompson</span></p><span></span><p><span>《性别麻烦》朱迪斯 巴特勒</span></p><span></span><p><span>《性别表演》朱迪斯 巴特勒</span></p><span></span><p><span>《明清士人与男旦》 程宇昂</span></p>]]></description>
